  <h2>Screenshots</h2>
  <p>No login or setup needed to capture your own — every tool is public and instant. Good starting points: the <a href="https://ratekit.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">homepage</a>, the <a href="https://ratekit.org/roi-calculator" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ROI calculator</a>, and the <a href="https://ratekit.org/safe-calculator" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SAFE note calculator</a>. Append <code>?embed=1</code> to any calculator URL for a clean, chrome-free screenshot of just the tool.</p>

  <h2>Usage</h2>
  <p>You're free to write about RateKit, screenshot it, link to it, and embed it — no permission needed, no exclusivity, no fee. If you'd like a quote, a walkthrough, or have a question before publishing, email below.</p>

